OL,3,GNEWSAFans to be kept apart again at
OL,4,Asouth coast derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice will keep rival football fans
OL,7,Fapart at the south coast derby this
OL,8,Fweekend in a bid to prevent disorder.
OL,10,FThe match between local rivals
OL,11,FSouthampton and Portsmouth at St Mary's
OL,12,Fon Sunday will see the return of away
OL,13,Fsupporters travelling under a tightly
OL,14,Fcontrolled "bubble" system, supported
OL,15,Fby Hampshire police.
OL,17,FAssistant Chief Constable Simon Dodds
OL,18,Fsaid the force worked with the clubs to
OL,19,F"make sure that we get it right and and
OL,20,Fhopefully celebrate the success of
OL,21,Fanother safe, enjoyable game for
OL,22,Feveryone".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
